Well, since I have ascended with almost 6 million points, I feel qualified
to answer this...
 Warning:  Spoilers Ahead.

I assume you get points for monsters killed, and for personal attributes
(stats, intrinsics, etc.) but there really isn't too much you can do about
those points...  The three things to really keep in mind about scoring are:

1:  There is a ten percent penalty for dying permanently.
2:  Pets!!!  Pets next to you at ascenscion are worth a lot of points.
3:  Money.  Gold pieces worth of treasure go to points in your score.
    This is the really big one...get as many valuable gems as you can 
    possibly stuff in your bag of holding.

